    "_id": "k5733xbeff6grnf9w024q3q4wx85pg15",
    "answer": "**Hinge joints** (e.g., elbow, knee, finger joints): allow movement in **one plane only** (flexion and extension, uniaxial).\n\n**Ball-and-Socket joints** (e.g., shoulder, hip): the rounded head of one bone fits into a cup-like socket of another, allowing movement in **multiple planes** including rotation (multiaxial).",
    "difficulty": null,
    "dueAt": null,
    "isDue": true,
    "lapseCount": null,
    "lastRating": null,
    "lastReviewedAt": null,
    "locked": false,
